{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And he shall split it with its wings.</b> With its wings — he need not pluck its feathers. Its wings — actual feathers. And is there any common person who smells the odor of burning feathers and does not loathe it? Why then does Scripture say 'he shall offer'? So that the altar may be sated and adorned with the offering of the poor."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:22:32.596204407Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}